2xx: Success (your code is fine)
- 200 OK: Request succeeded
- 201 Created: New resource made
- 204 No Content: Success, nothing to return

3xx: Redirect (check URL + caching)
- 301 Moved Permanently: Update URL
- 302 Found: Temporary redirect
- 304 Not Modified: Use cached version

4xx: Client Error (fix request/auth/params)
- 400 Bad Request: Invalid input
- 401 Unauthorized: Missing/invalid auth
- 403 Forbidden: Auth OK, no permission
- 404 Not Found: Endpoint/resource missing
- 409 Conflict: State/version mismatch
- 422 Unprocessable: Validation failed
- 429 Too Many Requests: Rate limited

5xx: Server Error (check server logs, and upstream for some)
- 500 Internal Error: Server crashed
- 502 Bad Gateway: Upstream failed
- 503 Service Unavailable: Overloaded/maintenance
- 504 Gateway Timeout: Upstream too slow
